+  "The predicates the folded `program` declares contracts or schemas over that
+  `request`'s context defines apart from `head`, each as `[callable digest]`:
+  the context's SCI Var and the digest of the definition it stands for (the
+  program's own row, else `head`'s), so equal definitions share one derived
